# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Full-resolution originals stay on your Mac; they do NOT belong in git.
#
# These are ~15 MB each straight off the camera (7008x4672). Committing them
# would push the repo past 150 MB, and git keeps every version forever, so it
# could never be shrunk back down afterwards.
#
# The site does not need them. It serves photos/optimized/, which is ~4 MB and
# IS committed. Keep the originals safe in your own backup / Google Photos —
# you only need them locally to re-run `npm run photos`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
photos/originals/*
!photos/originals/.gitkeep

# Backups the photo build script writes. Safe to lose once you've pushed.
photos/photos.json.bak
photos/photos.json.broken-*

# Local editor / tooling config
.claude/

# macOS
.DS_Store
._*

node_modules/
